{"id":"pluto_t","lemma":"plutôt","pos":"adv","rank":289,"glosses":["rather, instead (indicating preference)","rather (introducing a correction or clarification)","rather, pretty, kind of (indicating intensity or degree)"],"ipa":"/ply.to/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3d/Fr-plut%C3%B4t.ogg/Fr-plut%C3%B4t.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Essaye plutôt ceci.","en":"Try this instead.","words":[{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},null,{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Pouvons-nous plutôt le faire lundi ?","en":"Can we do it on Monday instead?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"Monday"}]},{"text":"Faisons plutôt ça.","en":"Let's do that instead.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Elle est plutôt bonne.","en":"She's rather good.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"good","l":"bon"}]},{"text":"C'est plutôt cher.","en":"It's pretty expensive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334403","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"dearly, expensively"}]}]}